    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d280">

                <pb facs="0407" n="327" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg327"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Palma to
                        President Roosevelt</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-07-04"><hi rendition="#italic">July 4,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>On this memorable date for the American people I send my greetings to Your
                    Excellency, and make wishes for the prosperity of your great nation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. Estrada Palma</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">President of the Republic.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
